WEBVTT

00:14.000 --> 00:15.220
<i>Why...</i>

00:16.370 --> 00:17.960
<i>is he naked?</i>

00:18.680 --> 00:21.480
<i>And my lower back kind of hurts.</i>

00:21.480 --> 00:22.840
<i>W-Wait.</i>

00:22.840 --> 00:24.440
<i>Just calm down for a second.</i>

00:24.440 --> 00:26.680
<i>Be natural... Be casual...</i>

00:27.500 --> 00:30.120
W-We...

00:31.680 --> 00:34.440
didn't do anything, did we?

00:37.120 --> 00:38.740
You forgot?

00:41.180 --> 00:44.600
After you were the one 
begging for it so much?

00:45.150 --> 00:47.480
<i>Please stop!</i>

00:48.330 --> 00:49.480
Raeliana?

00:54.410 --> 00:55.680
Raeliana!

02:35.230 --> 02:36.620
Master Taylor!

02:36.620 --> 02:37.600
Adam!

02:38.110 --> 02:40.140
Please help me!

02:40.140 --> 02:42.600
Bring Raeliana to me!

03:05.160 --> 03:06.440
<i>What the...</i>

03:06.860 --> 03:09.330
Master, you are awake?

03:09.910 --> 03:13.320
Count Westernberg has just arrived to—

03:13.320 --> 03:14.600
Send him home.

03:15.050 --> 03:15.950
What?

03:15.950 --> 03:20.000
B-But to call off an appointment 
on such short notice...

03:20.000 --> 03:21.720
Raeliana has been kidnapped.

03:23.180 --> 03:26.830
S-Something so terrible 
has happened here at this estate?!

03:26.830 --> 03:29.770
And tomorrow is the engagement ceremony...

03:29.770 --> 03:32.290
Assemble all of the knights at once.

03:33.190 --> 03:35.940
The kidnapper should 
still be on the grounds.

03:36.500 --> 03:38.950
You saw who did it?!

03:38.950 --> 03:41.590
He's 183 centimeters tall,

03:41.590 --> 03:43.960
and wearing a black uniform.

03:44.180 --> 03:46.490
His hair is a deep gray color and wavy.

03:46.490 --> 03:48.080
And he has red eyes.

03:48.380 --> 03:52.240
He's in his late teens, but already 
carrying weapons. He's very dangerous.

03:52.240 --> 03:56.200
Did the young lady simply 
go out with Master Tay—

03:56.200 --> 03:57.150
Gideon...

03:58.750 --> 04:00.480
Try saying that again.

04:02.210 --> 04:03.930
The young lady was taken...

04:03.930 --> 04:08.590
by someone resembling Master Taylor, then?

04:09.180 --> 04:10.270
Exactly.

04:15.340 --> 04:18.240
<i>That was a pretty spirited exit,</i>

04:18.680 --> 04:21.960
<i>but we're still on the estate grounds.</i>

04:26.080 --> 04:27.240
Master Taylor...

04:27.500 --> 04:29.530
Why don't we go out for a bit?

04:34.440 --> 04:36.700
That's what I thought.

04:41.670 --> 04:44.640
<i>I'll just consider that an accident 
and forget about it.</i>

04:45.040 --> 04:48.140
<i>When I really think about it, 
he did save my life.</i>

04:48.890 --> 04:53.410
<i>But this body isn't even mine to begin with.</i>

04:53.760 --> 04:56.330
<i>Should I really be treating it like this?</i>

04:58.080 --> 04:59.290
Master Taylor...

05:00.620 --> 05:04.710
Do you think... I smell bad?

05:05.220 --> 05:08.570
I didn't take a bath last night.

05:17.210 --> 05:19.670
I feel so much better!

05:19.670 --> 05:23.270
Thank goodness there's a 
separate bathroom for the maids.

05:33.560 --> 05:37.360
<i>I always wanted to try on a maid uniform.</i>

05:41.420 --> 05:43.620
Feels like I'm cosplaying.

05:47.910 --> 05:49.050
Master Taylor!

06:00.580 --> 06:02.000
Master Taylor...

06:03.250 --> 06:05.720
Are you... hungry, perchance?

06:07.250 --> 06:09.350
Searching for the young lady?

06:09.350 --> 06:12.240
The duke went out to search for her himself?

06:12.580 --> 06:13.470
Yes.

06:15.320 --> 06:18.720
I am very sorry, my lord.

06:19.040 --> 06:23.360
Why would the duke go 
to the trouble of searching for her?

06:25.100 --> 06:26.510
It's all right.

06:26.510 --> 06:30.160
If you don't mind, 
I'd like to wait in the study.

06:30.740 --> 06:34.610
Very well. I will inform the master.

06:34.850 --> 06:38.280
Miss Raeliana McMillan, eh?

06:41.630 --> 06:44.090
It's been awfully noisy around here today.

06:44.090 --> 06:45.880
You didn't hear?

06:45.880 --> 06:50.480
Apparently the young lady just up 
and left the estate with Master Taylor.

06:51.270 --> 06:55.470
The duke has all the knights 
in the mansion out looking for her.

06:56.450 --> 06:58.890
Why'd it turn into such a big commotion?

06:58.890 --> 07:02.160
Does he think she's gonna 
cheat on him with Master Taylor?

07:02.160 --> 07:04.270
When their engagement ceremony's tomorrow?

07:04.270 --> 07:05.750
Who knows?

07:05.750 --> 07:09.120
I didn't know the master 
was so narrow-minded.

07:09.490 --> 07:11.860
You don't know much about the world, do you?

07:13.260 --> 07:16.080
It's the people who seem as cool 
and composed as he does

07:16.080 --> 07:18.750
who are the most persistent 
when it comes to love.

07:20.560 --> 07:21.670
<i>Uh-oh...</i>

07:21.670 --> 07:24.470
Who're you? Haven't seen you before.

07:24.470 --> 07:26.540
Maybe she's from the south building?

07:26.540 --> 07:29.920
A lot of new people have been 
hired there for the ceremony.

07:29.920 --> 07:31.570
Uh, that's right.

07:31.570 --> 07:34.370
I've just begun work in the south building.

07:34.370 --> 07:35.890
So what are you doing here?

07:38.570 --> 07:40.370
W-Well...

07:41.170 --> 07:45.820
I was instructed to pick up some food 
that the young lady can eat easily.

07:45.820 --> 07:47.230
The young lady?

07:47.230 --> 07:48.420
They found her?

07:48.420 --> 07:49.880
Uh, yes!

07:50.590 --> 07:52.600
But, well...

07:52.600 --> 07:55.820
She says she wants to be left alone 
for a little while, so...

07:55.820 --> 07:57.550
P-Please excuse me!

07:58.320 --> 07:59.680
Hang on.

08:12.700 --> 08:13.900
Take this, too.

08:14.590 --> 08:16.710
I heard she likes it.

08:17.720 --> 08:19.370
The young lady, I mean.

08:21.010 --> 08:22.490
Master Taylor!

08:23.350 --> 08:26.520
Look what I got! Chocolate fondue!

08:29.370 --> 08:31.390
Let's enjoy it out there.

08:36.390 --> 08:41.380
So it seems like he has all 
the knights out looking for us.

08:42.740 --> 08:47.500
I don't know if I'm ready 
to face Noah again just yet...

08:47.950 --> 08:51.850
And I'm sure there's someone 
in my room waiting for me.

08:52.640 --> 08:55.120
Since I finally got into this uniform,

08:55.120 --> 08:57.500
I'd like a little more time to myself.

09:07.320 --> 09:08.920
I get it.

09:08.920 --> 09:13.280
Nobody would try to come 
into Noah's personal study.

09:13.880 --> 09:16.660
Thank you, Master Taylor.

09:25.880 --> 09:28.040
<i>I gotta get my head on straight.</i>

09:32.720 --> 09:34.310
<i>It's strange.</i>

09:34.310 --> 09:36.120
<i>Since I came to this world,</i>

09:36.120 --> 09:39.050
<i>I understand the languages of every country.</i>

09:39.050 --> 09:42.090
<i>Is it an ability I gained 
when I reincarnated?</i>

09:42.090 --> 09:44.800
<i>I mean, it's a big help either way.</i>

09:46.930 --> 09:48.040
<i>Huh?</i>

09:48.040 --> 09:50.290
<i>It can't be... Noah?!</i>

09:51.090 --> 09:53.560
Is this the book you wanted?

09:55.930 --> 09:58.940
I was watching from behind, 
and it looked like you were struggling.

09:59.300 --> 10:02.090
<i>Count Keith Westernberg!</i>

10:02.830 --> 10:06.800
<i>He's Noah's right-hand man. 
He's well-loved in the novel, too.</i>

10:07.450 --> 10:10.910
<i>Wow... I feel like I'm meeting a celebrity!</i>

10:11.200 --> 10:12.820
Was this the wrong one?

10:12.820 --> 10:14.080
Huh?

10:15.720 --> 10:17.950
You can read Cryptian?

10:18.240 --> 10:20.600
Uh... yes.

10:20.980 --> 10:25.360
I had no idea <i>any</i> woman in this 
kingdom could read Cryptian.

10:25.360 --> 10:26.740
I'm shocked!

10:26.740 --> 10:27.800
Huh?

10:28.150 --> 10:30.240
Who taught it to you?

10:30.760 --> 10:33.480
Um... I learned it on my own.

10:34.030 --> 10:35.530
Really?!

10:35.530 --> 10:39.730
I've never known anyone who 
learned Cryptian independently!

10:39.730 --> 10:42.490
Why in the world are you working as a maid?

10:42.770 --> 10:44.610
Have you any interest in academics?

10:44.610 --> 10:46.460
Uh...

10:46.460 --> 10:47.860
I see.

10:55.100 --> 10:58.650
With you dressed like that, 
it's no wonder nobody could find you.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.660
U-Um...

11:07.180 --> 11:08.680
P-Pardon me!

11:08.680 --> 11:10.650
Oh, no, it's all right.

11:17.420 --> 11:20.650
S-Stay away from me, you pervert!

11:20.650 --> 11:22.480
Per...vert?

11:22.910 --> 11:24.410
Pervert?

11:24.410 --> 11:25.630
Yes!

11:25.630 --> 11:28.420
You took advantage of the fact 
that I was asleep!

11:28.420 --> 11:31.850
Raeliana, you seem to have 
the wrong idea about something.

11:31.850 --> 11:33.410
I do?

11:33.740 --> 11:37.430
Nothing happened between us last night.

11:37.720 --> 11:38.800
Huh?

11:38.800 --> 11:41.500
B-But my lower back was sore...

11:41.500 --> 11:44.300
That's because you slept on horseback.

11:44.760 --> 11:47.360
But you said I begged...

11:47.360 --> 11:48.800
Yes, in your sleep.

11:52.810 --> 11:56.870
My bedroom is closer 
to the entrance than yours,

11:56.870 --> 11:59.240
so I let you sleep there. That's all.

12:03.670 --> 12:08.310
I only wanted you to get 
a good night's sleep.

12:10.210 --> 12:12.880
Then why didn't you tell me honestly

12:12.880 --> 12:16.080
from the beginning that nothing happened?

12:22.440 --> 12:23.520
I'm sorry.

12:28.790 --> 12:30.970
It wasn't my intention to deceive you.

12:31.660 --> 12:34.330
<i>Huh? Did he just apologize?</i>

12:34.830 --> 12:37.730
<i>Noah, of all people? Am I dreaming?</i>

12:38.070 --> 12:40.570
Is what you just said how you really feel?

12:41.460 --> 12:43.890
Yes, it is.

12:51.280 --> 12:53.000
All right, then.

12:53.850 --> 12:57.120
Please don't ever play 
mean jokes on me again.

12:57.880 --> 12:59.270
Hey!

13:00.330 --> 13:03.510
So you forgive me, then?

13:05.510 --> 13:07.710
<i>Should I, I wonder?</i>

13:08.050 --> 13:10.000
<i>Considering all that's happened,</i>

13:10.000 --> 13:12.590
<i>I don't really want to 
forgive him that easily.</i>

13:16.520 --> 13:19.000
What are you doing?!

13:19.000 --> 13:20.910
You forgive me, right?

13:21.810 --> 13:25.280
I won't let go until you forgive me.

13:25.280 --> 13:27.490
<i>Where did this come from?!</i>

13:27.490 --> 13:30.520
<i>I thought I finally had 
the advantage for once!</i>

13:34.530 --> 13:38.160
Fine! Just let go of me, please!

13:51.450 --> 13:54.520
<i>What is going on here?</i>

13:57.600 --> 14:01.400
<i>Was what I just saw actually real?</i>

14:02.080 --> 14:05.660
<i>Is that really Noah Voltaire Wynknight?</i>

14:05.660 --> 14:07.780
<i>Did he eat something funny?</i>

14:08.820 --> 14:12.960
<i>I had no idea that girl 
was Miss Raeliana McMillan.</i>

14:14.000 --> 14:18.240
<i>I heard the two of them had 
a contractual relationship,</i>

14:19.090 --> 14:23.580
<i>but what I just saw between 
them was more than that.</i>

14:23.580 --> 14:25.580
<i>C-Could it be...</i>

14:25.580 --> 14:28.680
<i>he's actually serious 
about Miss McMillan now?</i>

14:30.450 --> 14:31.420
Keith...

14:31.840 --> 14:33.750
Duke...

14:33.750 --> 14:36.780
<i>He finally realized I was here?</i>

14:42.800 --> 14:45.760
When we heard that Brooks 
had kidnapped our daughter,

14:45.760 --> 14:49.850
my wife and I were deeply 
upset and rushed here.

14:50.190 --> 14:51.850
Please rest at ease.

14:51.850 --> 14:57.200
Francis Brooks and his cohorts 
are being held at Saint Bell Prison.

14:57.700 --> 15:00.010
Saint Bell Prison?

15:00.010 --> 15:03.110
The highest-security prison in the kingdom?

15:04.120 --> 15:06.890
No matter what dangers 
may arise from now on,

15:06.890 --> 15:11.000
I will protect Miss Raeliana McMillan
for the rest of my life.

15:11.000 --> 15:16.760
Then you will be carrying out tomorrow's 
engagement ceremony as planned?

15:17.040 --> 15:18.380
Of course.

15:41.550 --> 15:44.110
Who... might you be?

15:44.110 --> 15:46.800
I am Mary Wayne.

15:46.800 --> 15:49.790
<i>The</i> Mary Wayne!

15:50.660 --> 15:52.900
<i>Mary Wayne's dress shop</i>

15:52.900 --> 15:57.560
<i>is a place that all brides-to-be dream of.</i>

15:57.560 --> 16:00.240
<i>Anyone who wants to wear 
a dress that she made</i>

16:00.240 --> 16:03.210
<i>must be at or above a certain 
level of status and wealth.</i>

16:05.080 --> 16:09.200
<i>All of her sales come with strict conditions,</i>

16:11.090 --> 16:12.890
<i>and even when they're met,</i>

16:12.890 --> 16:16.320
<i>it's rumored that the buyer must wait 
a year to get the dress.</i>

16:16.790 --> 16:19.110
<i>The</i> Mary Wayne?

16:19.830 --> 16:23.760
This is the dress you will wear 
to your engagement ceremony tonight.

16:23.760 --> 16:27.580
It is a masterpiece I am most proud of!

16:27.580 --> 16:29.870
I-It's beautiful.

16:29.870 --> 16:33.340
The duke placed the order 
on such short notice!

16:33.340 --> 16:37.230
It was a real challenge to complete in time!

16:38.000 --> 16:41.740
I-I'm sorry Noah wasn't more thoughtful...

16:41.740 --> 16:44.360
We need a fitting to see 
if it needs any modifications!

16:44.360 --> 16:45.720
Put it on now!

16:45.720 --> 16:48.100
Y-Yes, ma'am!

17:18.440 --> 17:21.000
<i>An engagement ceremony...</i>

17:22.400 --> 17:25.940
<i>Saint Bell Prison, where Brooks 
and his buddies are now,</i>

17:25.940 --> 17:29.120
<i>is a place that no one 
ever leaves once they enter.</i>

17:30.130 --> 17:31.150
<i>Which means...</i>

17:31.960 --> 17:35.950
<i>Brooks won't be able to kill me now.</i>

17:37.030 --> 17:41.450
<i>So should I really go 
on with this engagement?</i>

17:46.540 --> 17:58.680
Congratulations! {omedetou several times}

17:58.680 --> 18:04.480
<i>I first proposed this contract 
with Noah to avoid being killed by Brooks.</i>

18:08.200 --> 18:13.390
<i>The one who falls for Noah in 
the novel is the protagonist, Beatrice,</i>

18:15.080 --> 18:17.720
<i>and I'm just Beatrice's friend...</i>

18:20.800 --> 18:24.420
<i>but I'm the one engaged to him now.</i>

18:45.070 --> 18:48.010
Is this really right?

18:55.200 --> 18:56.360
Noah?

18:58.670 --> 19:00.760
What are we doing?

19:03.440 --> 19:04.780
We're on a date.

19:05.270 --> 19:09.810
But I'm sure I was just 
lying in my bed a moment ago.

19:10.790 --> 19:15.160
There are fireworks 
over the Shamcane River tonight.

19:15.980 --> 19:19.840
Uh, that's not what I was asking...

19:22.300 --> 19:27.880
I sensed that you've been avoiding me, 
even before the ceremony.

19:28.850 --> 19:33.670
It will make others suspicious 
if you so blatantly avoid me.

19:36.190 --> 19:39.600
<i>I've fully taken on 
the role of his fiancée now.</i>

19:39.600 --> 19:42.360
<i>We're even on this fake date now...</i>

19:43.660 --> 19:47.600
Noah, there's something 
I want to talk to you about.

19:47.600 --> 19:48.850
I know.

19:48.850 --> 19:50.200
Huh?

19:50.560 --> 19:53.490
You've used me to suit 
your purposes all this time,

19:53.490 --> 19:56.000
and now you don't need me anymore,

19:56.000 --> 19:58.210
so you want to dump me, right?

19:58.210 --> 20:01.070
You don't have to put it that way.

20:01.070 --> 20:03.880
You make me sound like complete scum.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.660
But I'm right, aren't I?

20:05.660 --> 20:07.760
<i>I mean, he is, but...</i>

20:08.520 --> 20:13.720
Well, as a certain someone said, 
I'm guilty of blackmail.

20:17.460 --> 20:18.740
Raeliana...

20:19.550 --> 20:22.320
Stay by my side.

20:30.260 --> 20:32.470
Until you have no further use for me.

20:33.040 --> 20:35.560
<i>Yeah, of course.</i>

20:35.560 --> 20:38.050
<i>He makes it </i>sound<i> cool, at least...</i>

20:39.250 --> 20:41.360
And... that's all?

20:45.210 --> 20:48.790
That's really all you want?

20:55.480 --> 20:56.920
Yes, it is.

20:58.520 --> 20:59.560
Noah...

21:00.000 --> 21:03.310
Have you ever loved anyone before?

21:04.460 --> 21:05.720
No.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.740
Why not?

21:07.630 --> 21:10.720
Because I'm a duke of the royal family.

21:11.320 --> 21:17.080
What, is a duke of the royal 
family not allowed to love?

21:17.570 --> 21:21.320
No. Because the moment you do,

21:21.760 --> 21:24.720
you're taking on a tremendous risk.

21:26.680 --> 21:28.230
Well, even so...

21:29.510 --> 21:30.720
Even so...

21:31.450 --> 21:35.720
I think you'll end up 
loving someone someday.

21:36.970 --> 21:38.670
Just watch.

21:38.670 --> 21:42.120
I was right about the Gale family, wasn't I?

21:47.540 --> 21:49.250
How pretty!

22:03.620 --> 22:04.780
Raeliana?

22:06.810 --> 22:08.510
A girl...

22:08.870 --> 22:10.130
A girl?

22:13.490 --> 22:17.020
I see... a girl with yellow hair.

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Episode Seven</b>

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Why Raeliana Handed Her a Handkerchief</b>
